      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1887 opening of Our Lady of Snows Roman Catholic mission and school drew many families to settle near Nulato.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nulato%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before Europeans arrived, Koyukon Athabascans moved seasonally, establishing spring, summer, fall, and winter camps around Nulato.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
